[[Skyrim:Vokun (item)|Vokun]] is a steel [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest|dragon priest]] [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest Mask|mask]] obtained by killing the eponymous [[Skyrim:Vokun (creature)|Vokun]] within [[Skyrim:High Gate Ruins|High Gate Ruins]]. The artifact's enchantments increase your [[Skyrim:Alteration|Alteration]], [[Skyrim:Conjuration|Conjuration]], and [[Skyrim:Illusion|Illusion]] skills by twenty points when worn. It can be [[Skyrim:Workbench|tempered]] with [[Skyrim:Steel Ingot|steel ingots]].<includeonly>

For more information, see the [[Skyrim:Vokun (item)|Vokun]] article.</includeonly><noinclude>
